From bc62323e220c7b9abb182fd97b058016695c21c9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: build <build@localhost>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:21:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] Brand: runtime branding via BRAND_* env and public/brand
 (views, meta, manifest, landing, mail footer, PDF logos)

Generalised from the JT patch 0001: no brand is hard-coded. Text comes from
BRAND_* environment variables (lib/brand.rb), images and colours from
public/brand/, which is meant to be replaced by a bind-mounted brand pack.
The image ships a neutral default pack. Navbar console/AI links and the
upgrade button stay hidden. The DocuSeal attribution stays (AGPL-3.0 7b).
